  "decision": {
    "layerwise_vs_fixed_low": "supported across foreground metrics; layer-fixed-low, layer-fixed-mean, layer-LHL, and layer-LLH all improve FG-PSNR/FG-SSIM/FG-LPIPS with paired CIs excluding zero.",
    "layer_lhl_vs_layer_fixed_mean": "layer-LHL is not the unique best layer-wise schedule: FG-LPIPS favors layer-fixed-mean and Full-LPIPS also favors layer-fixed-mean; Edge-SSIM favors layer-fixed-mean.",
